# .graphifyignore — corpus scoping for the code graph.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS. Measured on graphify-out/graph.json, 08/11/2026: 48,777 nodes, 83,716
# edges, 3,740 communities, 1,266 of them singletons, 2,093 connected components with the
# largest holding only 51.1% of nodes, and 19.9% of edges crossing community lines. The two
# single biggest "communities" in this repo were both SESSION_LOG.md. That is not a graphify
# defect — it is ours: no ignore file, default Leiden resolution, no hub exclusion, and no
# declared partition to check the detected one against.
#
# Operator, 08/11/2026: "Instead of one big yarn ball of paths, we need to put the things
# that are mostly related together."
